[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13861.99, "timestamp": "03:51:01", "text": "某物。是的。是的，我做了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13864.469, "timestamp": "03:51:04", "text": "那条推文，或者就像一条明确的“不”信息，比如"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13867.99, "timestamp": "03:51:07", "text": "接下来要向Jock Next道歉，就像……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13870.309, "timestamp": "03:51:10", "text": "因为那一天，我想要成为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13874.15, "timestamp": "03:51:14", "text": "就像个大反派之类的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13877.269, "timestamp": "03:51:17", "text": "像个可爱的小可爱一样断裂"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13878.79, "timestamp": "03:51:18", "text": "纯的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13886.07, "timestamp": "03:51:26", "text": "谁是谁让我保持完整，让我保持完整"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13889.11, "timestamp": "03:51:29", "text": "它让我活了下来。我为什么希望他"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13892.15, "timestamp": "03:51:32", "text": "进入坏结局，然后……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13895.11, "timestamp": "03:51:35", "text": "他自己也堕落了，就像你知道的那样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13898.07, "timestamp": "03:51:38", "text": "打破一切"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13900.79, "timestamp": "03:51:40", "text": "比如他是谁，他是怎样的人，以及他如何为人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13902.469, "timestamp": "03:51:42", "text": "一切。是啊，那很糟糕。那是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13904.87, "timestamp": "03:51:44", "text": "我竟然会想到这一点，真是太残忍了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13907.11, "timestamp": "03:51:47", "text": "你就这么想吧。所以，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13909.99, "timestamp": "03:51:49", "text": "我感觉糟透了，非常糟，然后我就开始哭了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13913.59, "timestamp": "03:51:53", "text": "整整一个星期，光是想到这件事都会让我难受。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13918.07, "timestamp": "03:51:58", "text": "而且那天我做的还有，我甚至"}]